course: dictionary
lesson: 5423
title: Ladybird: a helpful little beetle
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A ladybird is a small round beetle, usually red or orange with black spots. You can work out what kind of thing it is from the words around it. «Every insect has 6 legs: ants, beetles, bees, ladybirds and grasshoppers all walk on 6 legs.» The list tells you ladybirds are insects, like ants and bees.
explain: «Spiders are not insects: they have eight legs and two body parts; a ladybird, a small spotted beetle, is an insect with six legs.» Here the words «a small spotted beetle» tell you exactly what a ladybird is. Spiders have eight legs, so the sentence is comparing the two.
explain: Ladybirds are helpful in gardens. They eat tiny insects called greenfly (also called aphids), which damage plants. Their bright red or orange colours with black spots are easy to see, so they stand out.
fact: A ladybird is a small round beetle, usually red or orange with black spots.
fact: Ladybirds eat tiny insects like greenfly, which damage plants.
fact: Ladybirds are insects, and insects have six legs.
fact: In the USA a ladybird is called a «ladybug», and some people say «lady beetle».
fact: A ladybird goes through four stages of life: egg, larva, pupa and adult.
exercise: What is a ladybird? | A green plant that grows in gardens | *A small round beetle, usually red or orange with black spots | A large grey bird that sings at night | A spider with eight legs
exercise: What do ladybirds eat? | Fish from the pond | Seeds from the bird table | *Tiny insects like greenfly | Huge leaves and flowers
exercise: «Spiders are not insects.» How many legs does a ladybird have? | *Six | Two | Ten | Eight
test: Why are ladybirds helpful in gardens? | *They eat greenfly that harm plants | They sing to the birds | They make honey | They eat the flowers
test: Which name for a ladybird is used in the USA? | Ladyhen | Ladycat | Ladyfly | *Ladybug
exam: Which statement about ladybirds is true? | A ladybird eats fish from the pond | A ladybird is a spider with eight legs | *A ladybird is an insect with six legs | A ladybird is a bird that flies at night
